      {"type":"hak_overlay","title":"HAK//NOTICE","messages":["Physical contact detected","Reward given in advance","Study session integrity compromised",{"kind":"thought","speaker":"player","text":"So the reward came before the work this time, and my feelings about that are harder to joke away."}]},
